Rüdiger Engel wrote:

<<snip>>


> Communicator 4.78 runs very smooth on my Flamingo+, but I have a strange
> DNS-Problem: It only opens connections to hosts I entered in /etc/hosts by
> hand. Not a very useful way to access WWW-pages. :( How can I solve this
